<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">ROMANFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romanfoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">ROMANFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">ƆFA MANE</para>
  <para style="mt1">ROMANFOƐ</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul hworɔle krataa he mane Yudafoɛ ne maen-maen nanufoɛ bɔ baayɛ Kristofoɛ wɔ Roman ne. Ne sɔ kuro ne te Roman ahemman ne ahenguro. Roman ahemman yeɛ ne ɔte Wiase tumi bɔ ɔtɔ so nzia ɔ. Ngrataa buru-ne-nná bɔ Paul hworɔle ne, ɛhe yeɛ ɔwale paa ɔ, na ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Korinto.</para>
  <para style="ip">Paul hworɔle krataa he kɔyɛ afoɛ 56 Y.A,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Y.A kyire Yesu Aberɛ so (Brɔfo: </char><char style="it">Common Era</char> anaa <char style="it">C.E</char>)</note> yeti nná ɛhe yeɛ ɔte Paul krataa bɔ oli moa ɔ, nakoso sɛ ɛnea Bible nanu a, ye ngrataa buru-ne-nná bɔ ɔhworɔle ne, ɛhe yeɛ oli moa ɔ. Ɛhe te kama paa, ofikyɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ sesane atee bɔ ɔne ye mmenia di nanu ɔ. Romanfoɛ nwomaa ne maa yɛnwu kyɛ, né bahworɔ ye wɔ Hebri Tworɔnzɛm nanu dadaada kyɛ, bɛkɔha nzɛmba ne bɛkohyire maen-maen nanufoɛ. Paul hyirehyirele nu kyɛ, sɛ Yudafoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛtte Yudafoɛ namukoraati de to nu kyɛ, Yesu yeɛ ɔte Mezaya ne a, bɛbanya gyinabea kõ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nikye deinn ti bɔ Paul hworɔle ye krataa ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, ne ɔkɔmaa yekonwu atee bɔ yɛkɔfa so yɛkɔyɛ teneneefoɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. Sɔ tenenee ne, ɔnnate Mose mmeraa nanu nyumaa bɔ ebie kɔyɛ naso, na mmom ɔnate gyidie bɔ yekonya ye wɔ Yesu Kristo nu, ɔne Nyameɛ adom so. Paul fale edwirɛ ne gyinane edwirɛ bɔ Habakuk hane naso, ɔhane kyɛ: “Gyidie yeɛ ɔkɔmaa teneneeniɛ konya ngoa ɔ.” ( <char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:17">Rom 1:17</ref> </char>) Yeti Nyameɛ abukye ye nwo atee ne amaa ebiala, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ɔte Yudaniɛ anaa ɔtte Yudaniɛ ne, bɔ ohia ala yeɛ ole kyɛ yekonya gyidie wɔ Yesu bɔ ɔte Kristo nanu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wɔ sɔ krataa he anu ne, Paul hane Greek dwirɛ bɔ bɛhyirele yebo “<char style="bdit">tenenee</char>” ne kɔbo aburasa; sɔ dwirɛ ne fite pee wɔ Romanfoɛ nwomaa nanu tra nwomaa biala bɔ ɔwɔ Kristofoɛ Greek Tworɔnzɛm nanu ne. Paul sa maa oliema nemɔ nwuni kyɛbɔ wafe bɛ, ɔdwene bɛ nwo, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɔtenga ma bɛ ɔ. Na ɔnate Nyameɛ adom so srɛle bɛ bɔ ne bɛkɔkenga ye krataa he ne po.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeti buru-ne-nzia nanu, Paul bobɔle oliema Kristofoɛ ngoko-ngoko 26 dumaa hyeale bɛ, na ɔhyeale ebiemɔ koso bɔ wammɔ bɛ dumaa ɔ.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa hyɛle yebo ne ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɔ yeti yeɛ odikyɛ bedɛ yɛ ngoa ɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18–3:20</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Atee bɔ Nyameɛ fa so de ngoa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21–4:25</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo maa yɛnya asetena foforɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1–8:39</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nhyehyɛɛ bɔ Nyameɛ ayɛ ama Israelfoɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 9:1-11:36">9:1–11:36</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kyɛbɔ odikyɛ Kristofoɛ bɔ bɛ bra (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1–15:13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul asɛnka adwuma ne bɔ ogyi ye nye so (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-29">15:14-29</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Adesrɛdeɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo, ne ngyeaa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 15:30-16:27">15:30–16:27</ref> </char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Me Paul, nde Yesu Kristo akoaa bɔ bafrɛ me kyɛ mmanyɛ somafoɛ. Baye me kyɛ nga Nyameɛ nzɛmba <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />bɔ ɔnate adiifoɛ nemɔ so hyɛle ye nwo bɔ wɔ Tworɔ Krongron nanu ne. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Sɔ nzɛmba ne fa Ɔwa nanwo, na bɛwole ye anwoɔnaen nu kyɛ David bosoniɛ, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />nakoso bɛnate honhom bɔ ɔte krongron né tumi so bɛtingyele ye bɛfili ewue nu, na ɛhene amaa wala ali kyɛ ɔte Nyameɛ awa. Na ye yeɛ ole y'Awurade Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Na yɛnate ye so yeɛ yanya adom ne asomafoɛ adwuma ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ye dumaa ti, maen mukoraati nate gyidie naso kɔyɛ sotie. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Na ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔboka bɛ bɔ bafrɛ bɛ kyɛ bɛyɛ Yesu Kristo deɛ naso.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Mefa krataa he mekɔma Nyameɛ adɔfo bɔ bafrɛ bɛ maa baayɛ akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Roman namukoraati:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Bɔ oli moa koraa ne, nnate Yesu Kristo so meda Nyameɛ ase mema ɛmɔ mukoraati, ofikyɛ gyidie bɔ ɛmɔlɛ ye ne, bɛka ye nwo dwirɛ wɔ wiase mukoraati. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Na Nyameɛ bɔ mefa me honhom mesõ ye, na meka Ɔwa nanwo nzɛmba ne di m'adanzeɛ kyɛ, daa biala mekaye ɛmɔ wɔ me mbaeɛ nu. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Ná mesrɛ ye daa kyɛ, sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé, na ɔte Nyameɛ pɛ a, afei de ngɔhora ngɔɔnea ɛmɔ boso. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ofikyɛ mafe ɛmɔ paa, na mepena kyɛ menwu ɛmɔ na mema ɛmɔ honhom nu akyɛdeɛ bie maa ɛmɔyɛ se. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Kyire kyɛ, mene ɛmɔ mukoraati, ebiala kɔfa ye gyidie kɔhyɛ ye mmango nguraen. <verse eid="ROM 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Aliemaa mɔ, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, mmerɛ pee yeɛ mayɛ m'adwene kyɛ ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ngonya aba bie ngofi ɛmɔ berɛ, kyɛbɔ nyane ye wɔ maen bɔ waha nemɔ berɛ ne. Nakoso basi me atee tonn maa waadwu ɛnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Mema Greekfoɛ ne bɛ bɔ bɛtte Greekfoɛ kerɛ, na mema anyanzafoɛ ne ngwaseafoɛ koso kerɛ, <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />yeti me nye aboro paa kyɛ ngɔɔha nzɛmba ne ngohyire ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔ wɔ Roman ne.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Ná menvɛle nzɛmba nanwo; nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɛhe yeɛ ɔte Nyameɛ tumi bɔ ɔfa dɛ́ ebiala bɔ ole gyidie ne ngoa ɔ; Yudaniɛ yeɛ oli moa, yeɛ afei Greekniɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Ofikyɛ nzɛmba nanu yeɛ bɛnwu Nyameɛ tenenee bɔ ɔnate gyidie so ne, na bɛ bɔ bɛle gyidie ne yeɛ bɛnwu ye ɔ, ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ: “Gyidie yeɛ ɔkɔmaa teneneeniɛ konya ngoa ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Na mmenia bɔ bɛnate atee bɔ ɔttemaye so bɛsi nahorɛ né atee ne, bɛye Nyameɛ yaa ne ali bɛfi anwuro betia bɛ bɔne ne bɛ nningyein bɔ ɔndengyɛ namukoraati, <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />ofikyɛ nikye biala bɔ odikyɛ bɛnwu ye bɛfa Nyameɛ nwo ne, ɔla bɛ nyunu pefee, Nyameɛ amaa banwu ye pefee. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ná ye suban ahoroɛ bɔ anyeɛ ngora nnwu ye, bɔ yeɛ ole ye tumi bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ daa ne Nyameɛ deinn bɔ ɔte ne, wala ali pefee fi mmerɛ bɔ ɔbɔle wiase ne, na nningyein bɔ wabɔ ne yeɛ ɔmaa bɛnwu ye ɔ. Yeti bɛlle nikye biala bɔ bɛfa bɛye bɛ nwo noa ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Ɔwɔ nu, né bɛse Nyameɛ, nakoso bannhyɛ ye anuonyam kyɛ Nyameɛ, na banna ye ase. Mmom nningyein bɔ mvasoɛ nne so yeɛ ne bɛdwene ye nwo ɔ, na bɛ tianu adwene yɛle awosii. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Né bɛnwa bɛse nworɛ, nakoso bɛyɛle ngwaseafoɛ, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />na anuonyam bɔ odikyɛ bɛfa bɛma Nyameɛ bɔ ɔmborɔ ne, bɛmaa ɔyɛle kyɛ anuonyam bɔ bɛfa bɛma nningyein bɔ ɔporɔ te kyɛ sona, nnomaa, ngaka bɔ bɛ gya nná, ne ngaka bɔ bɛtwe bɛ nwo ase statu.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Na ɔnate kyɛ bɛpena kyɛ bɛdi b'akɔnnɔ si nati, Nyameɛ yakyile bɛ mane bra-bɔne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkogua bɛ nipadua nanwo fiɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ofikyɛ nahorɛ bɔ ɔfa Nyameɛ nwo ne, bɛfa bɛsesane ngondombo, bɛlili abɔdeɛ ni, ná kyɛ ahaa bɛkɔsõ Ɔbɔadeɛ ne, abɔdeɛ mmom yeɛ bɛsõne bɛ ɔ. Ná Ɔbɔadeɛ ne yeɛ anuonyam ha ye daa, daa. Amen!<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Ɛhe ati, Nyameɛ yakyile bɛ mane nnaa nwo akɔnnɔ bɔ ɔyɛ tɛ, ná bɛ mmrasua nemɔ ne bɛ mmango mmrasua nyane nnaa nu kyɛfa bɔ otia abɔdeɛ nu nhyehyɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ mmrienzua nemɔ koso yakyile nnaa bɔ bɛne mmrasua kɔla ne, na benyane akɔnnɔ bɔ enu yɛ se bɛmane bɛ nwo, mmrienzua ne mmrienzua yɛle nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ tɛ, na benyane bɛ bɔne nanwo akatua.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Na ɔnate kyɛ né bɛnguro kyɛ benya Nyameɛ nwo nimdeɛ bɔ odi mu nati, Nyameɛ koso yakyile bɛ mane adwene bɔ ɔmvata, kyɛ bɛyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔttemaye. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Yeti nningyein bɔ ɔndengyɛ ngome yeɛ bɛyɛ ɔ: amumuyɛɛ, aborɛ, anyeborolɛ, ne bɔne. Na ahoɔyaa, awudie, manzoin, nnaka-nnaka, ne adwemmɔne ali bɛ ti. Bɛdi nzekure, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />bɛ noa yɛ yea, bɛtane Nyameɛ, bɛmmu nikye, bɛte dwɛɛ, bɛhoɔhoa bɛ nwo, bɛdwene adwemmɔne, na bɛndie b'awofo dwirɛ. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Bɛnde dwirɛ bo, ɛne bɛ yɛ apam a ɔnyɛ yé, bɛnnwu anwunvoin, na bɛ ti anu yɛ se. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Ɔwɔ nu, sɔ mmenia hemɔ se Nyameɛ mmeraa ne paa kyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ ne, ewue yeɛ ɔfata bɛ ɔ. Nakoso nná ɛyɛlɛ ngome yeɛ bɛkɔsõ bɛyɛ ɔ, mmom bɛsosɔ bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ naso.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Yeti, sɛ ɛte nzu sona po na ebu ebie atɛn a, ɛlle nyeanoɛ biala. Na mmerɛ bɔ ebu ebie atɛn ne, né ebu wɔ nwo fɔ, ofikyɛ wɔ bɔ ebu atɛn ne, nningyein komapɛ nala bie yeɛ ɛyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Yɛse kyɛ Nyameɛ atemmuo te nahorɛ, na ɔla berɛ ma bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ nningyein nemɔ ne. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Na wɔ, mmerɛ bɔ ɛbu bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ nningyein né atɛn na wɔ bɔbɔ ɛyɛ bie ne, w'adwene yɛ wɔ kyɛ ɛkɔnwati Nyameɛ atemmuo anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Anaa ɛnze kyɛ Nyameɛ ayamye ti, ɔpena kyɛ ɔboka wɔ maa enya adwene-sakra? Bɔ yeti ɛbu ye ayamye, ye ndoboaseɛ, ne ye aboterɛ pembe né animtia ne? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Nakoso ɔnate kyɛ ɛte dwɛɛ, ná ɛyɛlle w'adwene kyɛ ɛsakra nati, ɛboɔboa ɛyaa noa ma wɔ nwo wɔ kyẽa bɔ Nyameɛ kɔfa yaa paa na ɔkɔye ye atɛn tenenee ne ali ne. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Na “okotua ebiala kerɛ kyɛbɔ ye adwuma te ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Bɛ bɔ bɛfa animia bɛyɛ nningyein pa, ná bɛfa bɛpena anuonyam, nidie, ne nikye bɔ ɔmborɔ ne, ɔkɔma bɛ daa ngoa. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Nakoso, bɛ bɔ bɛkuro ngondii, bɛndie nahorɛ ne, na bɛyɛ bɔne ne, asotwe ne ɛyaa yeɛ ɔkɔwa bɛ so ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Sona biala bɔ ɔyɛ bɔne ne, amanehunu ne ɔhaw yeɛ ɔkɔwa ye so ɔ; okoli moa kɔwa Yudaniɛ so, kora ne wawa Greekniɛ so. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Nakoso ebiala bɔ ɔyɛ nikye pa ne de, okonya anuonyam, nidie ne asomdwie; Yudaniɛ yeɛ oli moa, kora ne Greekniɛ. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ de, ɔnyeye mmenia nu.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle bɔne, bɔ né bɛnze mmeraa nanwo hwee namukoraati, nná mmeraa ne yeɛ begyina so bɛsɛkye bɛ ɔ; nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛwura mmeraa nabo namukoraati de, sɛ bɛyɛ bɔne a, mmeraa naso yeɛ bɛkogyina bɛkobu bɛ atɛn ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Ofikyɛ nná bɛ bɔ betie mmeraa ne yeɛ bɛte teneneefoɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu ɔ, mmom bɛ bɔ bɛfa mmeraa ne bɛyɛ adwuma ne yeɛ bɛkobu bɛ teneneefoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, maen-maen nanufoɛ ne de, bɛlle mmeraa, nakoso sɛ bɛfi aworɛ nu bɛyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ mmeraa nanu ne a, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ bɛlle mmeraa de, nakoso bɔ bɛyɛ ne te mmeraa ma bɛ bɔbɔ. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Bɔ bɛyɛ ne kyire kyɛ bahworɔ mmeraa ne bagua b'ahone nu, na b'ahonim koso di ye nwo adanzeɛ. Na b'adwene kora bu bɛ fɔ anaa bem. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Na kyɛbɔ nzɛmba bɔ meka né kyire ne, ɛhe kɔhɔ so kyẽa bɔ Nyameɛ nate Yesu Kristo so kobu nningyein bɔ sona biala afa afea nanwo atɛn ne.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Na wɔ koso, sɛ bɛfrɛ wɔ Yudaniɛ, na ɛfa wɔ nwo to mmeraa naso, ɛfa Nyameɛ hoɔhoa wɔ nwo, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ɛse Nyameɛ apɛdeɛ, ná bafa mmeraa ne bahyirehyire wɔ nati, edɛ bɔ ye nwo hia paa ne to nu, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />ná edɛ di kyɛ wɔ yeɛ ɛkyire anyesiniwaafoɛ atee, ɛte kanea ma bɛ bɔ bɛte awosii nu, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />ɛtete bɛ bɔ bɛnze nworɛ, ɛkyire ngwalaa nikye, ɛse nningyein titire bɔ ɔwɔ Mmeraa nanu ne, ɔne nahorɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Mmeraa nanu ne a, <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />ye de, wɔ bɔ ekyirekyire ebie ne, ekyirekyire wɔ nwo? Wɔ bɔ ɛka kyire ebie kyɛ “Nnɛwia” ne, aso ewia? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Wɔ bɔ ɛka kyire ebie kyɛ, “Nnɛsɛkye agyaa” ne, aso ɛsɛkye agyaa? Wɔ bɔ ekyi bosoen ne, ewia nningyein wɔ bosoen sua nu anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Na wɔ bɔ ɛfa mmeraa ne hoɔhoa wɔ nwo ne, aso ebu mmeraa naso fa gua Nyameɛ nyunu ase? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ: “Ɛmɔ ti, bɛka mmusue dwirɛ bɛfa Nyameɛ dumaa nanwo wɔ maen-maen nanu.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Sɛ edi mmeraa naso a, ye de mvasoɛ wɔ wɔ toa bɔ apɛ naso, nakoso, sɛ ebu mmeraa naso a, ye de, wɔ toa bɔ bapɛ ne, ɔte kyɛ bɛpɛlle wɔ toa nala. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Na sɛ ebie bɔ ɔte ɛtó di nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ Mmeraa nanu naso a, bɛngɔbu ye kyɛ ebie bɔ bapɛ ye toa anaa? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Sɛ ebie bɔ ɔte ɛtó di mmeraa naso a, ɔkɔbu wɔ bɔ ɛbu mmeraa naso ne fɔ, ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ ɛse mmeraa nanu dwirɛ, ná bapɛ wɔ toa ne. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Sɛ bɛka kyɛ ebie te Yudaniɛ a, nná yeɛ ole bɔ anyeɛ nwu ye ne, yeɛ toa pɛlɛ koso, ɔtte anyeɛ so ne anwoɔnaen nu nikye. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Na mmom Yudaniɛ paa yeɛ ole sona bɔ ɔte Yudaniɛ wɔ ye ahone nu, na ye toa pɛlɛ ne koso te ahone nu deɛ, bɔ ɔnate honhom so, ná ɔtte mmeraa bɔ bahworɔ naso. Sɔ sona ne, Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔye ye ayɛ ɔ, na ɔtte kuro sona.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ ɔmaa Yudaniɛ di mu ɔ? Na mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɔwɔ toa pɛlɛ so ɔ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Mvasoɛ pee yeɛ ɔwɔ so ɔ. Bɔ oli moa ne, Yudafoɛ yeɛ bɛfale Nyameɛ noa dwirɛ bɛwurale bɛ sa ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Na sɛ bɛ nu biemɔ annya gyidie koso ɛ? Gyidie bɔ bannya ye ne kyire kyɛ Nyameɛ ngoli nahorɛ anaa? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Dabida! Sɛ sona biala te ngondomboniɛ po a, Nyameɛ de, odi nahorɛ, kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛkoli bem wɔ wɔ dwudwolɛ nu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">na sɛ bɛbu wɔ atɛn a, ali ngunim.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Na sɛ yɛ nneyɛɛ bɔ ɔndengyɛ ne ma Nyameɛ tenenee da adi a, ahaa nzu yeɛ yɛkɔha ɔ? Ɛhene kyire kyɛ Nyameɛ fɛ yɛ so yaa a, wanyɛ ye yé anaa? (Me dwudwo kyɛ kuro sona.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Dabida! Ye de ahaa ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne Nyameɛ abu wiase ne atɛn? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Na sɛ mepɛ anoanu maa Nyameɛ nahorɛ da adi pefee, na ɔhyɛ ye anuonyam a, nzuati yeɛ bɛbu me atɛn kyɛ nde ɔbɔnefoɛ ɔ? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Ye de edwirɛ bɔ ebiemɔ fa to yɛ so kyɛ yɛka ne, nzuati yeɛ ahaa yɛnga bie ɔ? Bɛnwa yɛka kyɛ: “Ɛmɔma yɛyɛ bɔne, na nikye pa fi nu bra.” Sɔ mmenia nemɔ de, bɛ atemmuo ne fata bɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nzu bieku yeɛ yɛka ɔ? Aso yɛtra bɛ bɔ baha ne? Dabida! Ofikyɛ yali moa yaha kyɛ, Yudafoɛ ne Greekfoɛ amukoraati wura bɔne bo; <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">“Sona biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte teneneeniɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:10">komapɛ po nne berɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />Ebiala nne berɛ bɔ ole ndeaseɛ ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">ná ebiala mbena Nyameɛ.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Sona biala amini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">na mvasoɛ nne bɛ nu biala so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">bɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔyɛ pa ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">sona-horɛ po nne berɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />“Bɛ konvi te asieleɛ bɔ ɛso abukye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">bɛfa bɛ temverema bɛlaka-laka mmenia.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">“Na ɛwoo noa borɔ wɔ bɛ noa nu.”<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />“Amoen ne edwirɛ bɔ ɔyɛ yea ngome yeɛ ɔwɔ bɛ noa nu ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />“Sɛ bɛkwaahwie mogya bɛgua a, bɛ nwo nyera.”<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />“Ɛsɛkyelɛ ne amanehunu yeɛ ɔwɔ b'atee so ɔ,<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />na bɛnnwuni asomdwie atee ne.”<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />“Nyameɛ nwo suronyi biala nne bɛ nye so.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Kesaalae yɛse kyɛ bɔ mmeraa ne ka biala, ɔka ma bɛ bɔ bɛwura mmeraa nabo ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ebiala kɔha ye noa kɔto nu, ná wiase mukoraati abu ngondaa ahyire Nyameɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Yeti, bɛngɔfa mmeraa nanu nningyein bɛngɔbu sona biala bem wɔ ye nyunu, ofikyɛ mmeraa yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwu bɔne yé ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Afei koso, nná mmeraa yeɛ ɔmaa yɛnwuni Nyameɛ tenenee ɔ, na sɔ ala yeɛ mmeraa ne adiifoɛ nemɔ di ye nwo adanzeɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Bɛ bɔ bɛle gyidie namukoraati, sɛ benya gyidie wɔ Yesu Kristo nu a, bɛkɔhora bɛkɔɔyɛ teneneefoɛ. Ofikyɛ nzonzonyɛ biala nne bɛ nu. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />Ebiala ayɛ bɔne, yeti bɛndwu Nyameɛ anuonyam nanwo. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Na akyɛdeɛ yeɛ Nyameɛ afa ama bɛ, kyɛ ye adom ti, ɔnate Kristo Yesu agyedeɛ naso abu bɛ bem. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nyameɛ fale ye mane kyɛ afɔleɛ, kyɛ yɛnya gyidie wɔ ye mogya nanu, ná wamaa yasiesie yɛne ye afia. Nyameɛ yɛle sɔ fa hyirele ye bɔbɔ ye tenenee, ofikyɛ ye aboterɛ ti, wabu ye nye wagua bɔne bɔ bɛyɛle ye daa naso. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Ɔyɛle sɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔla ye tenenee ali wɔ mmerɛ he anu, na wamaa wayɛ teneneeniɛ mmerɛ po bɔ obu sona bɔ ole gyidie wɔ Yesu nu ne bem ne.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ yɛfa yɛhoɔhoa yɛ nwo ɔ? Baye bafi berɛ. Mmeraa beni yeɛ bɛnate so bɛye bɛfili berɛ ne? Mmeraa nyumaa ne anaa? Daabi, mmom gyidie mmeraa ne. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Ɛhe maa yɛnwu kyɛ, gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa bɛbu ebie bem ɔ, ná ɔtte mmeraa nanu nningyein bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ne. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Anaa ɔte Yudafoɛ ngome Nyameɛ? Aso ɔtte mane-maen nanufoɛ ne koso Nyameɛ? Yoo, ɔte maen-maen nanufoɛ ne koso Nyameɛ. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Ɔnate kyɛ Nyameɛ te komapɛ nati, gyidie yeɛ okogyina so kobu bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne bem, na bɛ bɔ bɛte ɛtó ne koso, bɛ gyidie yeɛ okogyina so kobu bɛ bem ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Ye de, yɛ gyidie ti, yatu mmeraa ne yagua anaa? Daabi oo! Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛmaa mmeraa ne gyina.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Sɛ sɔ yeɛ ɔte a, ye de nzu yeɛ yɛkɔhora yɛkɔha kyɛ, Abraham bɔ ɔte yɛ nana wɔ anwoɔnaen nu ne nyane ye ɔ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Sɛ Abraham nyumaa yeɛ ɔmaa bɛbule ye bem a, ahaa okonya nikye bie kɔhoɔhoa ye nwo, nakoso nná Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Nakoso, nzu yeɛ tworɔnzɛm ne ka ɔ? Ɔka kyɛ: “Abraham nyane gyidie wɔ Nyameɛ nu, na bɛbule ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Sɛ ebie yɛ adwuma a, akatua bɔ bɛfa bɛma ye ne, ɔtte akyɛdeɛ, mmom ɔte kerɛ bɔ odikyɛ bɛtua bɛma ye ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Nakoso, sona bɔ ɔnyɛ adwuma, ná onya gyidie wɔ bɔ obu abɔnefoɛ bem nanu ne, ye gyidie ti, bɛbu ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />David koso hane anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> bɔ ebie nya ye, mmerɛ bɔ Nyameɛ akwati nyumaa abu ye teneneeniɛ ne; ɔhane kyɛ:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />“Anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> yeɛ ole sona bɔ Nyameɛ afa ye mmerato ahyɛ ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">na wakata ye bɔne so ne;<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />anigye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nhyira.”</char></note> yeɛ ole sona bɔ Awurade ngobu ye bɔne nwo ngondaa ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Aso bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne ngome yeɛ bekonya nhyira he ɔ, anaa bɛ bɔ bɛpɛlle bɛ toa ne koso boka so? Ofikyɛ yɛnwa, “Abraham gyidie yeɛ ɔmaa bɛbule ye teneneeniɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Mmerɛ beni yeɛ bɛbule ye teneneeniɛ ne? Mmerɛ bɔ ne wapɛ ye toa ne, anaa mmerɛ bɔ né ɔpɛlle ye toa ne? Sɔ mmerɛ ne, né ɔpɛlle ye toa, mmom né ɔte ɛtó. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Ye toa bɔ ɔpɛle ne te nzɛngyerɛneɛ bɔ okyire kyɛ, ye gyidie ti, Nyameɛ buli ye teneneeniɛ mmerɛ bɔ né ɔte ɛtó ne, ná ɔfa hyɛle ye nzorɛ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛle gyidie ná bɛte ɛtó namukoraati baba, ná wamaa bɛ koso, babu bɛ kyɛ bɛte teneneefoɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Afei koso, ne ɔkɔyɛ bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne baba, nná bɛ bɔ bɛbata toa pɛlɛ nwo ne ngome, mmom bɛ bɔ bɛlili gyidie bɔ ne yɛ baba Abraham le ye kora yeɛ ɔbaapɛ ye toa ne si pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Ɛbɔ bɔ bɛhyɛle Abraham ne ye bosofoɛ kyɛ wiase ne kɔyɛ b'agyapadeɛ ne, né ɔnnate mmeraa so, mmom ɔnate tenenee bɔ ye gyidie maa onyane ye naso. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Sɛ bɛ bɔ bɛdi mmeraa so yeɛ benya agyapadeɛ ne a, ye de né mvasoɛ biala nne gyidie so, na bɔhyɛ ne koso ayɛ mbaen. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmeraa ne fa ɛyaa ba, na nekaa bɔ mmeraa nne berɛ ne, ebiala ndo mmeraa.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ bɔhyɛ ne nate gyidie so ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a okogyina adom so, ná yebo atimu ama ye bosofoɛ mukoraati; nná bɛ bɔ bɛdi mmeraa naso ne ngome, mmom bɛ bɔ bɛle Abraham gyidie ne bie ne koso. Ofikyɛ ɔte yɛ mukoraati baba. <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />(Na sɔ ala yeɛ bahworɔ ɔ, bahworɔ kyɛ: “Mafa wɔ mayɛ maen pee baba.”) Ɔte yɛ baba wɔ Nyameɛ bɔ onyane gyidie wɔ ye nu ne nyunu, Nyameɛ he yeɛ otingye bɛ bɔ bawu ne, ná nningyein bɔ ɔnne berɛ ne, ɔka ye nwo dwirɛ kyɛ ɔwɔ berɛ ne. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Né anidasoɛ biala nne berɛ, nakoso Abraham nyane anidasoɛ, na onyane gyidie kyɛ, ɔkɔyɛ maen pee baba, kyɛbɔ né baha kyɛ: “Sɔ yeɛ wɔ bosofoɛ kɔyɛ ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Ɔwɔ nu, né ɔpena nya afoɛ 100, nakoso ye gyidie anyɛ mmerɛ ɔmva ye nwo kyɛ, né onwu ye kyɛ ye nipadua ne awu ayie, na ɔye Sara koso ngora wo ne. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Nakoso Nyameɛ bɔhyɛ nati, onyane gyidie, ná wanzu aporowaa, mmom ye gyidie ne maa onyane anwoserɛ, na ɔhyɛle Nyameɛ anuonyam. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Na né odɛ di paa kyɛ, ɛbɔ bɔ Nyameɛ ahyɛ ne, ɔkɔwa nu. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ “obuli ye kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ” ne. <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Nakoso edwirɛ, “obuli ye teneneeniɛ” ne, nná ye ngome yeɛ bɛhworɔ bɛmane ye ɔ, <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />mmom bɛhworɔ bɛmane yɛ koso. Na ɔnate kyɛ yedɛ bɔ otingyele y'Awurade Yesu fili ewue nu ne yɛdi nati, bɛkobu yɛ teneneefoɛ. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Yɛ bɔne ti yeɛ bɛyele ye bɛmane ne, na bɛtingyele ye, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, okobu yɛ teneneefoɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Yeti, kesaalae bɔ yɛ gyidie ti, babu yɛ bem ne, ɛmɔma yɛfa y'Awurade Yesu Kristo so, na yɛne Nyameɛ tena asomdwie nu. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Gyidie bɔ yɛle ye wɔ Yesu nu nati, yanya ye nwo atee yapingye Nyameɛ, na sɔ adom ne yeɛ yɛwɔ nu ne. Na Nyameɛ adom bɔ yekonya ye nanwo anidasoɛ nati, yɛdi ahurusi.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔma yɛli ahurusi.”</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Nná ɛhene angome, mmom ɛmɔma yɛli ahurusi mmerɛ bɔ yɛnwu amaneɛ ne, ofikyɛ yɛse kyɛ amanehunu fa animia ba, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />na animia ne maa Nyameɛ dɛ́ yɛ to nu, na sɛ Nyameɛ dɛ́ yɛ to nu a, yɛnya anidasoɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Na anidasoɛ ne de, onni hwamɔ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ nate honhom krongron bɔ ɔfa mane yɛ naso ahwie ye dɔ agua y'ahone nu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛtɛ́ yɛ mmerɛ ne, Kristo wu mane abɔnefoɛ, wɔ mmerɛ bɔ ne bahyɛ nanu. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Ɔkɔyɛ se paa kyɛ ebie kowu kɔma teneneeniɛ; sona pa de, ebia ebie kowu kɔma ye. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Nakoso Nyameɛ amaa yanwu ye paa kyɛ ɔdɔ yɛ, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛtɛ́ te abɔnefoɛ ne, Kristo wu mane yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Ɔnate kyɛ kesaalae bɛnate ye mogya naso babu yɛ bem nati, kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ɔnate ye so kole yɛ kofi ɛyaa nanu. <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛte Nyameɛ atamfo ne, ɔnate Ɔwa ne wue naso siesiele yɛne ye afia, ye de kesaalae bɔ wasiesie yɛne ye afia ne, kyɛbɔ ɔte biala ne, ɔnate ye ngoa naso kole yɛ maa ɔkɔbo so. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Nná ɛhe angome, mmom y'Awurade Yesu Kristo bɔ yɛnate ye so asiesie yɛ ne Nyameɛ afia nati, yɛdi ahurusi wɔ Nyameɛ nu.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Ná ɔnate sona-horɛ so yeɛ bɔne wale wiase ɔ, ná ewue nate bɔne so wale, maa yeti ewue atrɛ aha ebiala, ofikyɛ sona biala ayɛ bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Né bɔne wɔ wiase kora yeɛ mmeraa ba ɔ, nakoso sɛ mmeraa nne berɛ a, bɛmmu ebiala fɔ wɔ bɔne nwo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ɛhe mukoraati nu ne, ewue lili sona so fili Adam so tonn oodwuli Mose so, na bɛ bɔ bannyɛ bɔne bɔ Adam yɛle ne bie ne po, olili bɛ so. Né Adam te kyɛ bɔ ɔkɔwa ne.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Nakoso akyɛdeɛ ne de, ɔtte kyɛ bɔne ne. Ɔte nahorɛ kyɛ sona-horɛ bɔne ti yeɛ mmeni pee awu ɔ, nakoso Nyameɛ adom ne te piri paa, na sɔ ala yeɛ ye akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɔnate sona-horɛ bɔ yeɛ ole Yesu Kristo n'adom so fa ma ne, wabu so wama mmeni pee. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Afei, Nyameɛ akyɛdeɛ ne, ɔne sona-horɛ ne bɔne ne, ɔtte pɛ. Ofikyɛ bɔne kõ bɔ sona ne yɛle ne maa bɛbule ebiala fɔ, nakoso bɔne pee si po ne, akyɛdeɛ ne amaa babu mmeni pee kyɛ bɛte ateneneefoɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ɔte nahorɛ kyɛ, bɔne kõ bɔ sona-horɛ yɛle nati, ewue nate sɔ sona naso lili tumi. Nakoso bɔ ofili Yesu Kristo deɛ nanu wale ne te piri tra ɛhene koraa; ebiala bɔ onya Nyameɛ adom bɔ wabo so, ne tenenee akyɛdeɛ ne, ɔnate sona-horɛ, bɔ yeɛ ole Yesu Kristo naso koli hene wɔ ngoa nu.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Yeti, kyɛbɔ bɔne komapɛ ne maa bɛbule ebiala fɔ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ tenenee komapɛ ne maa bɛbu ebiala bem, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonya ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Na kyɛbɔ sona-horɛ ne asoserɛ ne maa mmeni pee yɛle abɔnefoɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ sona-horɛ ne sotie ti, mmeni pee kɔyɛ teneneefoɛ. <verse eid="ROM 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Mmeraa ne wale kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɔne kɔsone. Nakoso nekaa bɔ bɔne ne sone ne, Nyameɛ adom ne sonene maa ɔbole so. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Na kyɛbɔ bɔne ne ewue lili hene ne, sɔ ala yeɛ adom nate tenenee so koli hene, na ɔnate y'Awurade Yesu Kristo so kɔfa yɛ kɔhɔ daa ngoa nu ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ yɛka ɔ? Aso odikyɛ yɛkɔ so yɛtena bɔne nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, adom ne kobu yɛ so anaa? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Dabida! Sɛ yawu yama bɔne a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ né yahɔso yatena nu? <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Anaa ɛmɔnze kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ bɛbɔle yɛ asu wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne, né babɔ yɛ asu wɔ ye wue nanu? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ yɛbɔle asu yɛhɔle ye wue nanu ne, bɛsiele yɛne ye mukoraati, ná kyɛbɔ Baba ne nate ye anuonyam so tingyele Kristo fili ewue nu ne, yɛ koso odikyɛ yɛnate asetena foforɛ nu.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Na sɛ yɛne ye ayɛ kõ wɔ atee bɔ ɔfale so wuli nanu de a, sɔ ala yeɛ yɛne ye kɔyɛ kõ wɔ atee bɔ bɛfale so bɛtingyele ye nanu ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Afei yɛse kyɛ, babɔ Kristo ne yɛ suban daa ne asɛnnua nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛ nipadua bɔ bɔne wɔ ye nwo ne kowu, ná yannyɛ ngoaa yamma bɔne kõ. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ wawu ne, bafa ye bɔne bahyɛ ye.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Babu ye bem wɔ ye bɔne nwo.”</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Na sɛ yɛne Kristo awu de a, yedɛ yɛdi kyɛ yɛne ye kɔtena ase. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ofikyɛ yɛse kyɛ Kristo bɔ batingye ye bafi ewue nu ne, ongowu kõ; ewue lle tumi biala wɔ ye so kõ. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Na ewue bɔ owuli ne, owu fa yele bɔne fili berɛ pɛn kõ, ná ase bɔ ɔte ye kesaalae ne, ɔte ma Nyameɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Yeti ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ ɛmɔ awu bama bɔne, na ɛmɔ nate Kristo Yesu so bɛte ase bɛma Nyameɛ.<verse eid="ROM 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa bɔne kɔ so di hene wɔ ɛmɔ nipadua bɔ owu naso, ná ɛmɔ anyɛ bɔ okuro ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ nnɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nipadua ne bɛma bɔne, maa ɔfa yɛ nningyein bɔ ɔttemaye ɔ. Mmom ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nwo bɛma Nyameɛ kyɛ mmenia bɔ batingye bɛ bafi ewue nu, na ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nipadua namukoraati bɛma Nyameɛ ma ɔfa yɛ nikye bɔ ɔtengyɛ. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Nnɛmɔ maa bɔne di ɛmɔ so, ofikyɛ ɛmɔnne mmeraa bo, mmom ɛmɔwura adom bo.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Ye de, nzu bieku? Ɔnate kyɛ yɛnne mmeraa bo, na yɛwɔ adom bo nati, odikyɛ yɛyɛ bɔne anaa? Daabi oo! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ɛmɔnze kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nwo bɛma ebie kyɛ ngoaa, na ɛmɔyɛ sotie bɛma ye a, etielɛ bɔ ɛmɔtie ye nati, ɛmɔte ye ngoaa? Ɛmɔ kɔhora bɛkɔyɛ ngoaa bɛkɔma bɔne bɔ ɔkɔ ewue nu, anaa sotie bɔ ɔkɔ tenenee nu. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Nakoso yɛda Nyameɛ ase paa, ɔwɔ nu, mmerɛ bie, né ɛmɔte bɔne ngoaa, nakoso ɛmɔ afi ɛmɔ ahone mukoraati nu bayɛ sotie bama ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛmane ɛmɔ ne. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Wamaa ɛmɔ alɛ́ ɛmɔ nwo koraa bafi bɔne nwo, na ɛmɔ ayɛ ngoaa bama tenenee. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Ɛmɔ nwonaen bɔ ɔyɛ mmerɛ nati yeɛ mefa sona adwene me dwudwo mekyire ɛmɔ ne. Kyɛbɔ mmerɛ bie, ɛmɔ fale ɛmɔ nipadua akwaa bɛyɛle ngoaa bɛmane bra-bɔne<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngyerɛaseɛ Tee: “Ɛfiɛ.”</char></note> ne mmerato maa ɔyɛle nningyein bɔ ɔto mmeraa ne, sɔ ala yeɛ kesaalae de, odikyɛ ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nipadua ne bɛyɛ ngoaa koraa bɛma tenenee maa ɔyɛ nningyein bɔ ɔte krongron.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Mmerɛ bɔ ne ɛmɔte bɔne ngoaa ne, né ɛmɔ ne tenenee afia atete koraa. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Sɔ bra bɔ kesaalae ɔyɛ ɛmɔ fɛle kyɛ ɛmɔ bɔle ne, mvasoɛ beni yeɛ ɛmɔnya bɛfili so ɔ? Bɔ ofi sɔ nningyein nanu ba yeɛ ole ewue. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Nakoso kesaalae de, balɛ́ ɛmɔ bafi bɔne nu koraa, na ɛmɔte Nyameɛ ngoaa. Yeti ɛmɔsu mmaa bɔ ɔte krongron, ná ye awieɛ yeɛ ole daa ngoa. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Ofikyɛ bɔne akatua yeɛ ole ewue, na akyɛdeɛ bɔ Nyameɛ fa me yeɛ ole daa ngoa bɔ ɔnate y'Awurade Kristo Yesu so ne.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Nniema mɔ, ɛmɔnze kyɛ ebie te ase a, yeɛ mmeraa kyekye ye hɔ? (Ofikyɛ me dwudwo mekyire bɛ bɔ bɛse mmeraa ne.) <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Ebie yeɛ ole kyɛ, brasua bɔ wagya ne, mmeraa akyekye ye abata ohu nwo, mmerɛ bɔ brienzua ne te ase ne. Nakoso sɛ ohu ne wu a, walɛ ye nwo wafi mmeraa bɔ ne wakyekye ye nanwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Yeti mmerɛ bɔ ohu te ase ne, sɛ ɔkɔ brienzua foforɛ nwo a, wasɛkye agyaa. Nakoso sɛ ohu wu a, mmeraa ne ngyekye ye kõ, yeti sɛ ogya biaa foforɛ a, ɔsɛkyelle agyaa.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Aliemaa mɔ, sɔ ala yeɛ ɔte wɔ ɛmɔ afa nu ɔ. Ɛmɔnate Kristo nipadua naso awu bama mmeraa ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ kɔyɛ sona foforɛ deɛ; ɛmɔ kɔyɛ bɔ bɛtingyele ye bɛfili ewue nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ kosu mmaa bɛkɔma Nyameɛ ne deɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ yɛte ase wɔ anwoɔnaen nu ne, bɔne akɔnnɔ bɔ mmeraa ne kanyane ye ne, ɔyɛle adwuma wɔ y'akwaa nu, na osuli mmaa bɔ ɔkɔ ewue nu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Nakoso kesaalae de, balɛ́ yɛ bafi mmeraa nabo, ofikyɛ yawu yama bɔ ne wakyekye yɛ ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛkɔfa honhom naso yɛkɔyɛ ngoaa wɔ atee foforɛ so, ná ɔtte atee daa bɔ né bahworɔ ne.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ yɛpena yɛkyire ɔ? Yɛnwa mmeraa ne te bɔne anaa? Daabi! Nakoso sɛ nná mmeraa ne ahɔ a, ahaa menze bɔne. Ofikyɛ sɛ mmeraa ne anga kyɛ, “Nnɛmaa wɔ nye boro wɔ mmango nikye” a, ahaa menze anyeborolɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Nakoso sɔ mmeraa nati, bɔne nyane ye nwo atee fale anyeborolɛ wurale me nu, ofikyɛ sɛ mmeraa nne berɛ a, bɔne awu. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ne mmeraa nne berɛ ne, ndenane ase. Nakoso mmeraa ne wale ne, bɔne sa mane ye nwo so maa nwuli. <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />Yeti mma nwuni kyɛ, mmeraa bɔ ahaa odikyɛ ɔfa ngoa ba ne, ewue mmom yeɛ ɔfa wale ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Ofikyɛ mmeraa nati, bɔne nyane ye nwo atee laka-lakale me, na ohuni me. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Yeti mmeraa ne te krongron, na ahyɛdeɛ ne koso te krongron, ɔtengyɛ, na ɔte pa.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Ye de, nikye pa bie yeɛ ɔmaa nwuli anaa? Daabi oo! Bɔne mmom yeɛ ɔmaa nwuli ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bekonwu ye kyɛ, bɔne yeɛ ɔnate nikye pa bie so wafa ewue wawa me so ɔ, na wamaa bɔne afa ahyɛdeɛ naso ala ye nwo ali kyɛ ɔttemaye koraa. <verse eid="ROM 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Yɛse kyɛ mmeraa ne te honhom nu nikye, na me de, nde anwoɔnaen bɔ batɔne me kyɛ akoaa bama bɔne. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Na bɔ meyɛ ne po, mende yebo; ofikyɛ bɔ mepena kyɛ meyɛ ne, nná ɛhene yeɛ meyɛ ɔ, bɔ menguro ne mmom yeɛ meyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Ɔnate kyɛ bɔ menguro yeɛ meyɛ nati, medɛ́ meto nu kyɛ mmeraa ne te pa. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Yeti nná me bɔbɔ deinn yeɛ meyɛ sɔ nningyein ne, mmom bɔne bɔ ɔte me nu ne, yeɛ ɔyɛ sɔ ne. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ofikyɛ mese ye paa kyɛ, me nu, kyire kyɛ me nipadua nu ne de, nikye pa biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte nu ɔ; ofikyɛ mepena kyɛ meyɛ nikye pa, nakoso mengora ye yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Pa bɔ mekuro ne, menyɛ, bɔne bɔ menguro ne mmom yeɛ meyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Yeti sɛ bɔ menguro yeɛ meyɛ a, ye de nná me yeɛ meyɛ ɔ, bɔne bɔ ɔte me nu ne mmom yeɛ ɔyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Yeti, mmeraa he yeɛ manwu ye wɔ me nwo ɔ, yeɛ ole kyɛ: Mmerɛ biala bɔ mepena kyɛ meyɛ pa ne, né bɔne aye yeti. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Me nu paa de, me nye gye Nyameɛ mmeraa nwo, <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />nakoso menwu mmeraa foforɛ wɔ me nu, bɔ ɔkõ tia mmeraa bɔ ɔwɔ m'adwene nu ne, na ɔfa me yɛ akoaa ma bɔne mmeraa bɔ ɔte me nu ne. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Me dwirɛ yɛ anwunvo paa! Nwa yeɛ okole me kofi nipadua bɔ ɔkɔ ewue nu he anu ɔ? <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Asennaa fa y'Awurade Yesu Kristo so ha Nyameɛ! Afei, mafa m'adwene mayɛ akoaa mama Nyameɛ mmeraa, nakoso mafa me nwonaen mayɛ akoaa mama bɔne mmeraa.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Yeti bɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne, benni fɔ kõ. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Ofikyɛ honhom né mmeraa bɔ ɔma yɛ ngoa wɔ Kristo Yesu nu ne, wamaa ɛmɔ alɛ́ ɛmɔ nwo koraa bafi bɔne ne ewue mmeraa nanwo. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Ɔnate kyɛ yɛ nwonaen ne maa mmeraa ne yɛle mmerɛ nati, bɔ mmeraa ne angora ye yɛ ne, Nyameɛ ayɛ. Atee bɔ ɔfale so yɛle yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔsomane Ɔwa ne maa ɔwale, na ɔfale sona nipadua wale te kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɔne wɔ yɛ nwo nala, na obuli bɔne fɔ wɔ anwoɔnaen nu, <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a tenenee bɔ mmeraa ne pena ne kɔwa nu wɔ yɛ bɔ yɛnate honhom nu ná yɛnnate anwoɔnaen nu naso. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛnate anwoɔnaen nu ne, bɛfa b'adwene besie anwoɔnaen nu nningyein so, nakoso bɛ bɔ bɛnate honhom nu ne fa b'adwene sie honhom nu nningyein so. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Adwene bɔ ogyi anwoɔnaen nu nningyein so ne, ewue yeɛ ɔfa ba ɔ, nakoso adwene bɔ ogyi honhom nu nningyein so ne fa ngoa ne asomdwie ba. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ɛhe ati, sɛ ebie fa y'adwene sie anwoɔnaen nu nningyein so a, okyire kyɛ ɔte Nyameɛ tamfo, ofikyɛ ondie Nyameɛ mmeraa, na ɔngora nyɛ sɔ po. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Yeti bɛ bɔ bɛmaa anwoɔnaen kyire bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ ne, bɛngora bɛnyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Nakoso ɛmɔ de, sɛ ɔte amba kyɛ Nyameɛ honhom te ɛmɔ nu a, ye de honhom ne yeɛ okyire ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ, na ɔtte anwoɔnaen ne. Ebiala bɔ olle Kristo honhom ne, ɔtte Kristo deɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Nakoso sɛ Kristo wɔ ɛmɔ nu a, bɔne ti ɛmɔ nipadua ne awu, nakoso tenenee ti ɛmɔ honhom ne te ase. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Na sɛ bɔ otingyele Yesu fili ewue nu né honhom te ɛmɔ nu a, ye de bɔ otingyele Kristo Yesu fili ewue nu ne, ɔnate ye honhom bɔ ɔte ɛmɔ nu naso kɔmaa ɛmɔ nipadua bɔ owu ne koso konya ngoa.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, yɛma kerɛ, nakoso yɛmma anwoɔnaen ne kerɛ, yeti yɛnyɛ bɔ anwoɔnaen ne kuro ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ofikyɛ sɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔ anwoɔnaen ne kuro a, ewue yeɛ ɛmɔ kowu ɔ, nakoso sɛ ɛmɔma honhom ne ku ɛmɔ nneyɛɛ tɛɛ ne a, ɛmɔ kɔtena ase. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ bɛmaa Nyameɛ honhom kyire bɛ atee ne, bɛte Nyameɛ mmaa. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Na honhom bɔ ɛmɔ nyane ye ne, ɔtte honhom bɔ ɔmaa ɛmɔyɛ ngoaa anaa ɔmaa esuronyi ka ɛmɔ ɔ, mmom honhom ne maa ɛmɔyɛ Nyameɛ mmaa, na ɛhene yeɛ ɔmaa yɛteanu kyɛ: “<char style="tl">Abba</char>, Baba!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Honhom ne bɔbɔ ne yɛ honhom di adanzeɛ kyɛ yɛte Nyameɛ mmaa. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Sɛ yɛte Nyameɛ mmaa de a, yɛkoli bia.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛte koliagyaa.”</char></note> Amba, yekonya agyapadeɛ yɛkofi Nyameɛ berɛ, ná yɛne Kristo koso kɔbonu koli bia, nakoso sana yɛne ye nwu amaneɛ, kora ne bahyɛ yɛne ye anuonyam.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Nakoso menwu ye kyɛ amaneɛ bɔ yɛnwu ye kesaalae ne, sɛ yɛfa toto anuonyam bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkɔma yɛ nanwo a, ondwu ye neka-fee. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ná abɔdeɛ né nwondɛ paa kyɛ bɛkɔla Nyameɛ awa ne ali. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Ofikyɛ bafa abɔdeɛ ne bawura nikye bɔ mvasoɛ nne so bo, nakoso nná ye pɛ nu yeɛ ɔne ye wura yebo ɔ, mmom bɔ ɔfale ye wurale berɛ ne pɛ nu ɔ, na ɔyɛle sɔ wɔ anidasoɛ nu, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a abɔdeɛ ne bɔbɔ konya ahofadie kofi ɛporɔlɛ bɔ wafa ye wayɛ akoaa nanu, na wanya Nyameɛ anuonyam mmaa ahofadie ne bie. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Na yɛse kyɛ abɔdeɛ mukoraati pene, na banwu amaneɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Banwu amaneɛ te kyɛ ebie bɔ aworɛ aha ye.”</char></note> tonn maa waadwu ɛnɛ. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Nakoso nná abɔdeɛ ne ngome yeɛ ɔpene ɔ, mmom yɛ bɔ yanya aba bɔ oli moa, bɔ yeɛ ole honhom ne koso, yɛsu yɛgua yɛ nu mmerɛ bɔ yɛnwondɛ paa kyɛ bɛkɔfa yɛ bɛkɔyɛ mmaa, ná ɔnate agyedeɛ naso alɛ́ yɛ afi nipadua he anu ne. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Na sɔ anidasoɛ he anu yeɛ bɛlɛle yɛ ngoa ɔ; nakoso anidasoɛ bɔ yɛnwu ye de, ɔtte anidasoɛ, ofikyɛ sɛ sona nwu nikye bie a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛ ne wafa ye nye wato so? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Nakoso, sɛ yɛnnwu nikye bɔ yɛ nye la so ne a, yɛnya aboterɛ paa yɛnwondɛ.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ honhom ne boka yɛ, mmerɛ bɔ yayɛ mmerɛ ne. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, sɛ yɛnnwu nikye bɔ yɛbɔ ye nwo mbaeɛ po a, honhom ne bɔbɔ si yɛ gya nu serɛ ma yɛ mmerɛ bɔ yɛsu yɛgua yɛ nu ne. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Na bɔ ɔnea ahone nu ne se bɔ honhom ne pena kyire ɔ, ofikyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ pena ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ honhom ne srɛ ma akrongronfoɛ ne ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Yɛse kyɛ, nikye biala nu ne, Nyameɛ yɛ nningyein pa ma bɛ bɔ bɛdɔ ye ne, bɛ bɔ ye atirimbɔ ti, wafrɛ bɛ ne. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Ofikyɛ bɛ bɔ oli moa lɛle bɛ tole nu ne, ɔha tole berɛ kyɛ bɛkɔyɛ kyɛ ɔwa ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔwa ne kɔyɛ piesie wɔ aliemaa pee nu. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Na bɛ bɔ ɔyele bɛ ne, bɛ ala yeɛ ɔfrɛle bɛ ne, na bɛ bɔ ɔfrɛle bɛ ne, bɛ ala yeɛ obuli bɛ teneneefoɛ ne. Na bɛ bɔ obuli bɛ teneneefoɛ ne, bɛ ala yeɛ ɔhyɛle bɛ anuonyam ne.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ye de, nzu bieku yeɛ yɛka yɛfa ɛhemɔ nwo ɔ? Sɛ Nyameɛ ta yɛsi a, nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kɔhõ kotia yɛ ɔ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Ye bɔ ɔwa po, wamva ye wammɔ yɛ atianu serɛ, na yɛ ti, ɔfale ye mane ne, aso ɔngɔlo yɛ ngɔfa nikye biala ngɔboka ɔwa naso ngɔma yɛ anaa? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ aye bɛ ne, nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kɔbɔ bɛ kwaadu ɔ? Nyameɛ bɔbɔ yeɛ obu bɛ teneneefoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kobu bɛ fɔ ɔ? Kristo Yesu bɔ owuli, na bɛtingyele ye ne, ɔwɔ Nyameɛ sa famaa so, na ye yeɛ ɔsrɛ ma yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Nzu yeɛ ɔkɔhora kɔte yɛ kofi Kristo dɔ nwo ɔ? Aso amanehunu, ahokyere, ɔtaeɛ, ɛhɔen, adagya, asane, anaa dadeɛ kɔhora kɔte yɛ kofi ye nwo hɔ? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Wɔ ti, bɛku yɛ daa biala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">na bɛbu yɛ kyɛ mmoan bɔ bɛkwaapɛ yɛ ti ne.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Nakoso, sɔ nningyein hemɔ mukoraati nu ne, yɛnate bɔ ɔdɔ yɛ naso ali ngunim koraa. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Na nne gyidie paa kyɛ, ewue anaa ngoa, abɔfo anaa awaen, nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ kesaalae anaa bɔ ɔkɔwa kyẽabie, tumi, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro anaa nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ ase biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔte yɛ kofi Nyameɛ dɔ bɔ ɔwɔ y'Awurade Kristo Yesu nu nanwo ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Meka nahorɛ wɔ Kristo nu, membɛ anoanu; na m'ahonim koso di me adanzeɛ wɔ honhom krongron nu, <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />kyɛ medi aworaborɛ paa, na daa yealɛ wɔ m'ahone nu. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Ɔhale me ngome a, ahaa bate me bafi Kristo nwo kyɛ ebie bɔ badome ye, ná bafa me basi nniema nemɔ gya nu, nniema bɔ me ne bɛ bɔ abusua wɔ anwoɔnaen nu ne. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Bɛte Israelfoɛ, na bɛ yeɛ bafa bɛ bayɛ mmaa, ná anuonyam, apam ahoroɛ, mmeraa bɔ bɛfa bɛmane, ɔsom<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔsom bɔ ɔte krongron.”</char></note> ne bɔhyɛ nemɔ te bɛ deɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Bɛ nana yeɛ ole abusua panyin nemɔ, na anwoɔnaen nu ne, bɛ bosoniɛ yeɛ ole Kristo. Na Nyameɛ bɔ odi nikye biala so ne, ye yeɛ ayɛyie ha ye daa daa. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Nakoso, ɔtte kyɛ ebia Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne amma nu, ofikyɛ nná bɛ bɔ bɛfi Israel nu namukoraati yeɛ bɛte Israelfoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Afei koso, ɔtte kyɛ bɛte Abraham bosofoɛ nati, bɛ mukoraati bɛte ye mmaa mɔ. Mmom “Bɔ bɛkɔfrɛ ye wɔ bosoniɛ ne, ɔnate Isaac so yeɛ ɔkɔwa ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Yeti nná anwoɔnaen nu mmaa yeɛ bɛte Nyameɛ mmaa ɔ, mmom bɔhyɛ mmaa ne yeɛ bɛbu bɛ kyɛ bɛte ye bosofoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ofikyɛ bɔhyɛ ne ka kyɛ: “Afoɛ bieku bekye sɔa, ngɔwa ne, né Sara awo baa brienzua.” <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Nná ɛhe angome, mmom mmerɛ bɔ Rebeka ne sona-horɛ, yɛ nana Isaac nwonzɛle ndaafoɛ ne koso, <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />né benya bɛwolle bɛ, na né benya bɛyɛlle pa anaa bɔne, nakoso bɔ ɔkɔyɛ né Nyameɛ atirimbɔ ne anyina nyumaa so, na mmom wagyina bɔ ɔkɔye ye naso ne, <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Panyi ne kɔsõ kamba ne.” <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Sɔ ala yeɛ bahworɔ ye wɔ tworɔnzɛm nanu kyɛ: “Ne medɔ Yakob, na Esau de, né menguro ye dwirɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ yɛka ɔ? Nyameɛ bu ndɛngyea anaa? Dabida! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Ofikyɛ ɔha hyirele Mose kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">“Bɔ mekuro ne yeɛ ngonwu ye anwunvo ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">na bɔ mekuro ne yeɛ me kunu kɔtete me kɔma ye ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Yeti oggyi bɔ ebie kuro anaa ye mmɔdemmɔ so, mmom ogyi Nyameɛ bɔ onwu anwunvoin naso. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ofikyɛ tworɔnzɛm ne ha hyirele Farao kyɛ: “Bɔ yeti yeɛ mayakyi wɔ maa ɛtɛ́ te berɛ ne yeɛ ole kyɛ, ngɔye me tumi ne ali ngohyire wɔ, ná wamaa babɔ me dumaa wɔ aseɛ mukoraati so.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Yeti ebiala bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ne, yeɛ onwu ye anwunvo ɔ, na bɔ okuro ne, yeɛ ɔmaa ɔyɛ asoserɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Nakoso ebie kobisa me kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɔtɛ́ nwu mvomsoɛ wɔ sona nwo ɔ? Na nwa yeɛ ɔkɔhora kosi ye apɛdeɛ ne atee ɔ?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Sona, wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa bɔ ɛne Nyameɛ yeye ne? Aso kukue kɔhora kobisa bɔ onwone ye ne kyɛ: “Nzuati yeɛ ɛnwone me sɔa ɔ?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Sona bɔ onwo ngukue ne, aso olle tumi kyɛ ɔfa nnɛterɛ komapɛ nala bie nwo nningyein bɔ ole anuonyam, na ɔfa bie yɛ bɔ olle anuonyam? <verse eid="ROM 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Nyameɛ koso, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ ɔpena kyɛ ɔye ye yaa ne ali na ɔmaa bɛnwu ye tumi, nakoso sɛ onya nningyein bɔ wafɛ bɛ so yaa bɔ wasiesie kyɛ ɔkɔsɛkye bɛ nanwo aboterɛ paa koso ɛ? <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Sɛ ɔyɛle sɔ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔye ye anuonyam pembe ne ali kohyire anwenneɛ bɔ wanwu bɛ anwunvoin, bɔ wali moa wasiesie wato berɛ kyɛ ɔkɔhyɛ ye anuonyam, <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />bɔ yɛ bɔ ɔfrɛle yɛ fili Yudafoɛ ne maen-maen nanu ne boka so ne koso a, ahaa nzu yeɛ yɛkɔhora yɛkɔha ɔ? <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ waha ye wɔ Hosea nwomaa nanu ɔ, ɔhane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Bɛ bɔ ne bɛtte me maen ne, ngɔfrɛ bɛ ‘me maen.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Na maen bɔ ne mennɔ ye ne, ngɔfrɛ ye ‘me dɔfo.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Na nekaa bɔ bɛha bɛhyirele bɛ kyɛ, ‘Ɛmɔtte me mmenia ne,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">ɛberɛ yeɛ bɛkɔfrɛ bɛ ‘Nyameɛ teasefoɛ ne mmaa ɔ.’”<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Afei koso, Isaiah hane Israel nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">“Ɔwɔ nu Israelfoɛ dodoɔ te kyɛ ɛpo noa anweaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">nakoso bɛ nu kaa bie yeɛ bɛkole bɛ ngoa ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ofikyɛ Awurade kɔmaa bɛkobu aseɛ nanwo ngondaa bɛkohyire ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">na okoyie ye ndɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Afei koso, kyɛbɔ Isaiah ha tole berɛ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">“Sɛ asafo Awurade anyakyi yɛ bosofoɛ biemɔ berɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">ahaa yayɛ kyɛ Sodom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">na ahaa yayɛ te kyɛ Gomora.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Ye de, nzu bieku yeɛ yɛka ɔ? Bɔ yɛka yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ maen-maen nanufoɛ anni tenenee si, nakoso banya tenenee, tenenee bɔ ɔnate gyidie so; <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />nakoso Israel bɔ ne bɛle tenenee mmeraa ne, bangora banni mmeraa ne si pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Nzuati ɔ? Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, nná gyidie yeɛ bɛfa bɛlili ye si ɔ, na mmom nyumaa. Bɛfini “nyɔboɛ bɔ ɔto sintidua” naso; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />na bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Nea, mefa nyɔboɛ bɔ ɔto sintidua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ne nyɔboɛ bɔ ɔmaa bɛfi ase meto Zion;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">na bɔ okonya ye nu gyidie ne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ye nyunu ngogua ase lle.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, bɔ ɔla m'ahone so, ɔne bɔ mesrɛ Nyameɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ bekonya ngoa. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Ofikyɛ medi bɛ nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ bɛyere bɛ nwo bɛsõ Nyameɛ, nakoso nná nahorɛ nimdeɛ yeɛ bɛfa bɛyɛ sɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ne bɛnze Nyameɛ tenenee nati, bɔ b'adwene yɛ bɛ kyɛ ɔtengyɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ ne bɛli ye si ɔ. Yeti bammerɛ bɛ nwo ase banwura Nyameɛ tenenee nabo. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Na Kristo yeɛ ɔte mmeraa ne awieɛ ɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛkobu ebiala bɔ ole gyidie ne kyɛ ɔte teneneeniɛ.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Mose hworɔle tenenee bɔ ɔnate mmeraa so nanwo dwirɛ kyɛ: “Sona bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ɛhemɔ ne, ɔnate so konya ngoa.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Nakoso tenenee bɔ ɔnate gyidie so ne ka kyɛ: “Nnɛka ye wɔ w'ahone nu kyɛ, ‘Nwa yeɛ ɔkɔfo kɔhɔ anwuro ɔ?’ Kyire kyɛ, ɔkɔɔfa Kristo kɔwa ase, <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />anaa ‘Nwa yeɛ okodwu kɔhɔ kumaa kuron-kuron nanu ɔ?’ Kyire kyɛ ɔkɔɔfa Kristo kofi awufo nu kɔwa ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Mmom nzu yeɛ ɔka ɔ? Yenwa “Edwirɛ ne pingye wɔ, ɔwɔ wɔ noa ne w'ahone nu”; ɛhene yeɛ ole gyidie dwirɛ bɔ yɛka ne; <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />na sɛ ɛfa wɔ noa ka kyɛ Yesu te Awurade, na sɛ enya gyidie wɔ w'ahone nu kyɛ Nyameɛ atingye ye afi ewue nu a, bɛkole wɔ ngoa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Ofikyɛ sona ahone yeɛ ɔfa dɛ́ di maa bɛbu ye teneneeniɛ, na ye noa yeɛ ɔfa pakye nu ka kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a okonya ngoa ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Na tworɔnzɛm ne ka kyɛ: “Ebiala bɔ okonya ye nu gyidie ne, ye sa ngosi ase.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Na nzonzonyɛ biala nne Yudaniɛ ne Greekniɛ nu. Awurade komapɛ nala yeɛ odi bɛ mukoraati so, na obukye yesa nu ma ebiala bɔ ɔfrɛ ye ne. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Ná “ebiala bɔ ɔkɔbɔ Awurade dumaa kɔfrɛ ye ne, okonya ngoa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Nakoso, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne babɔ bɔ benne ye benni ne dumaa? Na ebie bɔ bɛtelle ye nwo dwirɛ ne, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne balɛ́ ye bali? Na sɛ ebie anga edwirɛ ne a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne bate? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Na sɛ banzoma bɛ a, ɔkɔyɛ sɛɛ ne baha edwirɛ ne? Na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne: “Bɛ bɔ bɛka nningyein pa nwo nzɛmba ne, bɛ gya bo yɛ nyemene kyɛ.” <verse eid="ROM 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Nakoso, nná bɛ mukoraati yeɛ betiele edwirɛ pa ne ɔ. Ofikyɛ Isaiah hane kyɛ: “Awurade, nwa yeɛ wale yɛ dwirɛ ne wali ɔ?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Yeti sɛ ebie konya gyidie a, ɔnate bɔ ɔkɔte naso, na bɔ ɔkɔte ne koso nate Kristo nwo dwirɛ so.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Ye de, ma mmisa oo: Bannde? Bɛtele! Nahorɛ dwirɛ yeɛ ole kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Bɛtele bɛ konvi wɔ wiase mukoraati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">na bɛ dwirɛ ne hɔle aseɛ ne noa nekaa biala.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Mesa me bisa kyɛ, né Israelfoɛ nemɔ nze hɔ? Né bɛse! Mose limoa hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Ngɔmaa ɛmɔ nye kɔboro bɛ bɔ bɛtte maen ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">na nnate maen bɔ bɛnze nworɛ so ngɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔfɛ yaa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Nakoso Isaiah nyane akukuduro hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Bɛ bɔ bambena me ne yeɛ bɛnwuni me ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">na bɛ bɔ bammisa me boso ne yeɛ maye me nwo ali mahyire bɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Na ɔhane Israel nwo dwirɛ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">“Kyẽa namukoraati, ndrɛle me sa nu mmane mmenia bɔ bɛ so yɛ se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">ná basenze bɛ kɔme ne.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ye de me bisa oo, Nyameɛ pole ye mmenia ne anaa? Daabi! Ofikyɛ me koso nde Israelniɛ, nde Abraham bosoniɛ, na mvi Bengyamin abusua nu. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nyameɛ ambo ye mmenia bɔ oli moa yele bɛ ne. Ɛmɔse bɔ tworɔnzɛm ne ka fa Elia nwo, mmerɛ bɔ né ɔbɔ Israelfoɛ sommoɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu ne? <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />Ɔka kyɛ: “Awurade, bahu wɔ adiifoɛ namukoraati, babubu wɔ afɔleɛ bokyea nemɔ, me ngome yeɛ maha ɔ, na me koso, bɛpena me bɛku me.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nakoso mmuayɛ beni yeɛ Ɛdangama ne fa mane ye ɔ? Ɔha hyirele ye kyɛ: “Nne mmenia 7,000 wɔ berɛ bɔ bɛ de, bɛbulle ndwerɛ bɛsonne Baal.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Na sɔ ala yeɛ ɛnɛ koso, ebiemɔ wɔ berɛ bɔ ɔnate adom so aye bɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Nakoso sɛ ɔnate adom so a, ye de ɔnnate nyumaa so kõ. Nná ye sɔ de a, ahaa adom ne, ɔtte adom kõ.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Ye de nzu bieku? Nikye bɔ ne Israel pena ne, wannya ye. Nakoso bɛ bɔ baye bɛ ne mmom yeɛ benyane ye ɔ. Bɛ ngaa ne de, né b'ahone yɛ se, <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />na kyɛbɔ tworɔnzɛm ne ka ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">“Nyameɛ maa bɛlale hatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">wama bɛ anyeɛ bɔ onnwu nikye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">ɔne asoɛ bɔ ɔnde dwirɛ tonn maa waadwu ɛnɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />David koso hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Ma bɛ tɛbulu ne yɛ ngaen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">ɔto bɛ sintidua, na ɔyɛ asotwe ma bɛ.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ma bɛ nye so yɛ bɛ tumm, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛngonwu nikye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">na ma bɛkundu bɛ nu daa.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Ye de mebisa: Mmerɛ bɔ Israel polili na bɛfine ase ne, bandwɔso kõ hɔ? Nná sɔ yeɛ ɔte ɔ! Mmom bɔne bɔ bɛyɛle ne, wamaa maen-maen nanufoɛ ne anya ngoa kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔkɔyɛ Israel yea. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Na sɛ bɛ bɔne ne maa wiase ne nyane ye nwo, ná bɛ so bɔ ɔtele ne maa maen-maen ne nyane ye nwo a, ye de sɛ bɛ dodoɔ ne bɔ yenoa a, nea bɔ okosi ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Afei medwudwo mekyire ɛmɔ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne. Ɔnate kyɛ nde maen-maen ne somafoɛ nati, mehyɛ me som adwuma né anuonyam, <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ngɔfa atee bie so ngɔha bɛ ayinga maa bɛkɔfɛ yaa, na male bɛ nu biemɔ ngoa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Na sɛ bɛpole bɛ ne, ɔmaa bɛsiesiele Nyameɛ ne wiase ne afia a, ye de sɛ bedɛ bɛ a, nzu yeɛ ɔkohyire ɔ? Ɔkɔmaa bɛ bɔ bawuwu ne konya ngoa. <verse eid="ROM 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Afei koso, sɛ mɔle ne bue bɔ bɛfale ye kyɛ aba bɔ oli moa ne te krongron a, ye de nnaa mɔle namukoraati te krongron, na sɛ bakaa ne ndii ne te krongron a, ye de ye sa mmaa nemɔ koso te krongron.<verse eid="ROM 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Nakoso sɛ bapepɛ ye sa mmaa ne bie bagua, na bafa wɔ bɔ ɛte olive bakaa bɔ ogyi eburo basi ye gya nu maa anya nningyein pa bɔ ofi ye ndii nanu ne bie a, <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />nnɛyɛ baka ne sa mmaa naso dwɛɛ. Sɛ ɛyɛ bɛ so dwɛɛ a, kaye kyɛ nná wɔ yeɛ ndii ne gyi wɔ so ɔ, wɔ mmom yeɛ ɛgyi ndii naso ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ebia ɛkɔha kyɛ: “Bɛpepɛle ye sa mmaa ne bie, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔfa me bɛkotua so ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ɛhene te nahorɛ! Ofikyɛ gyidie bɔ bannya ye nati yeɛ ɔmaa bɛpepɛle bɛ ne, nakoso wɔ de, gyidie ti yeɛ wamaa ɛgyi berɛ ɔ. Nnɛyɛ dwɛɛ, mmom suro. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Sɛ Nyameɛ amva bakaa ne bɔbɔ sa mmaa ne nwo angyɛ ye a, ye de wɔ koso ɔngɔfa wɔ nwo ngɔhyɛ wɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Dwene kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ kunu te pa, ná ye dwirɛ yɛ se nanwo. Bɛ bɔ bɛfini ase ne, ɔhwene bɛ so, nakoso wɔ de, sɛ ɛkɔso tena ye ayamye nanu a, Nyameɛ kɔhɔ so kɔye ye ayamye ne ali kohyire wɔ; nakoso sɛ anyɛ sɔ a, ɔkɔpɛ wɔ kofi berɛ. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Na bɛ koso, sɛ benya gyidie a, ɔkɔfa bɛ kootua ye nwo, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ kɔhora kɔfa bɛ kotua ye nwo bieku. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Ofikyɛ olive bakaa bɔ né ogyi eburo ne po, bɛhora bɛpɛle ye sa mmaa ne bie bɛfa beetuale olive bakaa bɔ ogyi turo nanu nanwo maa ɔyɛle yé; ɔwɔ nu, nná sɔ yeɛ bɛyɛ ye ɔ. Na sɛ ɛhene ayɛ yé a, ye de bakaa ne bɔbɔ sa mmaa ne de, bɛfa betua ye nwo a, ɔngɔyɛ se koraa.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Nniema mɔ, mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu edwirɛ krongron bie bɔ wafea ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔngɔyɛ anyanzafoɛ wɔ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔ nye so. Yeɛ ole kyɛ: Israelfoɛ nemɔ bie apirim b'ahone, kodwu kyɛ maen-maen nanufoɛ ne dodoɔ kɔso. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Na sɔ atee he aso yeɛ Israel mukoraati konya ngoa ɔ. Na kyɛbɔ tworɔnzɛm ne ka ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Agyenkwa ne kofi Zion kɔwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">na ɔkɔye amumuyɛɛ kofi Yakob.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Na sɛ meye bɛ bɔne ne mefi berɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">apam he yeɛ mene bɛ kɔyɛ ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Nzɛmba nanwo de, ɛmɔ ti bɛte Nyameɛ tamfo; nakoso ɔfa bɛ bɔ Nyameɛ aye bɛ ne de, bɛ nana mɔ ti, bɛte adɔfo. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ akyɛdeɛ ne, ɔne ɛfrɛlɛ bɔ ɔfrɛle bɛ ne de, ɔtte nikye bɔ onu ye nwo wɔ ye nwo ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Na kyɛbɔ mmerɛ bie, né ɛmɔyɛ Nyameɛ so asoserɛ, na kesaalae de b'asoserɛ ne amaa banwu ɛmɔ anwunvo ne, <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />sɔ ala yeɛ kesaalae, ɛhemɔ ayɛ asoserɛ maa banwu ɛmɔ anwunvo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛ koso, afei de bɛkonwu bɛ anwunvo ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Nyameɛ afa bɛ mukoraati awura asoserɛ bo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a okonwu bɛ mukoraati anwunvo ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />O, nea kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ ahonyadeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">ye nyanza, ne ye nimdeɛ si sone ɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:33">Sɛ yɛka kyɛ yɛneɛnea ye atemmuo nu a, yɛngoyie lle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:33">Na ye atee koso, yɛngɔte yebo lle.<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />Na “nwa yeɛ wanwu Awurade adwene ɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Anaa nwa yeɛ wahora watu ye fo ɔ?”<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />Anaa “nwa yeɛ wali moa wama Nyameɛ nikye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">bɔ yeti odikyɛ otua ye nikye ma ye ɔ?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />Ofikyɛ ye yeɛ nikye biala fi ye berɛ, ɔnate ye so, na ɔte ye deɛ ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">Ye yeɛ anuonyam ha ye daa daa! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Yeti aliemaa mɔ, anwunvoin bɔ Nyameɛ anwu yɛ nati, mesrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ nipadua ne bɛbɔ afɔleɛ bɔ ɔte ase, ɔte krongron, na ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye. Na mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔfa ɔsom bɔ ɔte krongron bɛma ye ne, ɛmɔfa ɛmɔ adwene bɛsusu nningyein nwo yé. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Nnɛmɔ maa wiase ne kyire ɛmɔ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ɔ, mmom ɛmɔyɛ ɛmɔ adwene foforɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ konwu bɔ Nyameɛ kuro, bɔ ɔte pa, bɔ ɔsɔ ye nye, na odi mu ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Na ɔnate adom bɔ bafa balo me nati, meka mekyire ɛmɔ nu biala kyɛ, nnɛmaa obu ye nwo kyɛ odi mu tra so. Mmon onya anwobraseɛ adwene, kyɛbɔ gyidie bɔ Nyameɛ asusu ama ɛmɔ ne te ne. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Na kyɛbɔ yɛ nipadua ne te kõ, nakoso ole akwaa pee, na akwaa namukoraati koso nnyɛ adwuma kõ ne, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />sɔ ala yeɛ yɛ koso, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ yɛsone, nakoso yɛte nipadua kõ wɔ Kristo nu, na yɛ nu biala te nipadua n'akwaa. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Adom bɔ bafa balo yɛ nati, ebiala ne ye akyɛdeɛ. Sɛ ɔte ngɔmhyɛ a, ɛmɔma yɛhyɛ ngɔm kyɛbɔ yɛ gyidie te ɔ; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />sɛ yɛsõ ebie a, ɛmɔma yɛsõ; bɔ okyirekyire ne koso, ma ɔhɔ so hyirehyire; <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />bɔ ɔhyɛ ngunaen ne, ma ɔhɔ so hyɛ ngunaen, ná bɔ ɔkyɛ nikye ne, ofi y'ahone nu yɛ; bɔ odi nningyein nyunu ne, ɔyere ye nwo yɛ sɔ; na bɔ onwu mmenia anwunvoin ne, ɔfa anigye yɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Nnɛmɔ maa nyaatwom ba ɛmɔ dɔ nu. Ɛmɔhyi bɔne, na ɛmɔ bata pa nwo. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ɛmɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo kyɛ aliemaa mɔ, na ɛmɔli moa bɛfa nidie bɛma ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ɛmɔyere ɛmɔ nwo bɛyɛ adwuma, nnɛmɔyɛ akwadworɔ. Ɛmɔyɛ hye honhom nu, ɛmɔsõ Awurade.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔyɛ adwuma kyɛ ngoaa bɛma Awurade.”</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ɛmɔli ahurusi wɔ anidasoɛ nanu. Ɛmɔmia ɛmɔ nye begyina amanehunu nu. Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ daa. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ɛmɔboka akrongronfoɛ ma bɛ sa ha bɔ behia ɔ. Ɛmɔsõ mmenia wɔfoɛ.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Bɛ bɔ bɛtane ɛmɔ nye ne, ɛmɔhyira bɛ. Ɛmɔhyira, nnɛmɔ dome. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Bɛ bɔ bɛ nye agye ne, ɛmɔ ne bɛ li ahurusi; bɛ bɔ bɛsu ne, ɛmɔ ne bɛ su. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Adwene bɔ ɛmɔle ye wɔ ɛmɔ nwo ne, ɛmɔnya bie bɛma ebiala; nnɛmɔma ɛmɔ nwo so, mmom ɛmɔyɛ adwuma bɔ ɔba ase. Nnɛmɔ nya adwene kyɛ ɛmɔ ngome yeɛ ɛmɔse nworɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Sɛ ebie yɛ ɛmɔ bɔne a, nnɛmɔyɛ bie betua ye kerɛ. Bɔ ebiala nwu ye kyɛ ɔte pa ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɛmɔma ye nwo hia ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Sɛ ɔkɔyɛ yé a, ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔbɔ mmɔden kyɛ ɛmɔ ne ebiala kɔtena asomdwie nu. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Nniema mɔ, nnɛmɔfa bɔne betua bɔne so kerɛ; mmom ɛmɔyakyi bɛma Nyameɛ yaa ne; ofikyɛ bahworɔ kyɛ: “ ‘Me yeɛ metua bɔne so kerɛ ɔ; na ngotua so kerɛ,’ Awurade yeɛ waha ɔ.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Mmom, “sɛ ɛhɔen ku wɔ tamfo a, ma ye aleɛ ma oli; sɛ nzuhɔen ku ye a, ma ye nzue ma ɔno. Sɛ ɛyɛ sɔ a, né ɛboɔboa see noa gua ye ti afia.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Nnɛmaa bɔne di wɔ so ngunim, mmom fa pa di bɔne so ngunim.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Ɛmɔma sona biala brɛ ye nwo ase wura atumvoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ nabo, ofikyɛ tumi biala nne berɛ, sana bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ ne. Na atumvoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, Nyameɛ yeɛ wama bɛ atee kyɛ bɛli tumi ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔkɔdwɔso kotia atumvoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ berɛ ne, né odwɔso tia Nyameɛ nhyehyɛɛ, na bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ sɔ ne, bɛkɔfa atemmuo bɛkɔwa bɛ nwo so. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Sɛ ebie yɛ nikye pa a onzuro bɛ bɔ bɛdi tumi ne, bɔ ɔyɛ bɔne ne mmom yeɛ ɔsuro bɛ ɔ. Ɛnkuro kyɛ esuro atumvoɛ nemɔ anaa? Ye de yɛ nikye pa, na bɛkɔ kamvo wɔ. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ofikyɛ bɛte Nyameɛ asomvoɛ, na wɔ pa nu ti yeɛ bɛwɔ berɛ ɔ. Nakoso sɛ ɛyɛ bɔne de a, suro, ofikyɛ ottira dadeɛ ne mbaen. Ɔte Nyameɛ somvoɛ bɔ ɔtwe bɛ bɔ bɛyɛ bɔne ne so. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ odikyɛ ebu atumvoɛ nemɔ ne, nná asotwe bɔ ɛkɔkwati ne ngome ti ɔ, mmom w'ahonim<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Tiboa.”</char></note> koso ti. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ɛhene koso ati yeɛ odikyɛ etua toɔ ne, ofikyɛ atumvoɛ nemɔ te Nyameɛ asomvoɛ bɔ bɛsõ maen ne, na bɛyɛ b'adwuma daa. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Ɛmɔtua ebiala deɛ bɛma ye: bɔ odɛ́ toɔ ne, ɛmɔtua toɔ bɛma ye, bɔ odɛ́ alambo ne, ɛmɔfa alambo bɛma ye; bɔ odikyɛ ɛmɔsuro ye ne, ɛmɔfa esuronyi bɔ ɔte sɔ bɛma ye; na bɔ ɔfata nidie ne, ɛmɔfa nidie bɛma ye.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Nnɛmɔma ebiala kerɛ, sana ɔdɔ bɔ ɛmɔ kɔdodɔ ɛmɔ nwo ne ngome; ofikyɛ ebiala bɔ ɔdɔ ye mmango ne, wali mmeraa naso wayie. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ofikyɛ mmeraa ne ka kyɛ: “Nnɛsɛkye agyaa, nnɛdi awue, nnɛwia, nnɛmaa wɔ nye boro wɔ mmango nikye,” ɔne mmeraa foforɛ biala bɔ ɔwɔ berɛ ne, ye mukoraati bɔnu komapɛ kyɛ: “Dɔ wɔ mmango kyɛ wɔ nwo.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Sɛ ɛdɔ ebie a, ɛngɔyɛ ye bɔne, yeti sɛ ɛle ɔdɔ a, ali mmeraa naso.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ɛmɔyɛ ɛhe koso, ofikyɛ ɛmɔse mmerɛ ne. Ɛmɔse kyɛ, mmerɛ aso kyɛ ɛmɔ dwɔso bɛfi nnaa nu, ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ bɛkɔfa bɛkole yɛ ngoa ne, wapingye watra mmerɛ bɔ yɛɛyɔle gyidifoɛ ne. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Waha kaa maa kɔngɔen pɛ nu; na aleɛ ahe ayie. Yeti ɛmɔma yɛgyi awosii nu nningyein namukoraati yɛgua, na yɛfa kanea nu akodeɛ ne yɛwura. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ɛmɔma yɛbɔ bra pa, te kyɛ bɔ yɛnate eyia ne; ɔnzɛ kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ paati bɔ yebo gye-gyee-gye ne nzãa bolɛ, adwamammɔ ne ahohwibra, anaa manzoin ne ahoɔyaa. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Mmom ɛmɔfa Awurade Yesu Kristo bɛwura, na nnɛmɔyɛ nhyehyɛɛ biala bɛto berɛ bɛma anwoɔnaen akɔnnɔ, kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ bɔ okuro ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Sona bɔ ye gyidie yɛ mmerɛ ne, ɛmɔle ye bɛto nu. Na bɛ bɔ ɛmɔ ne b'adwene nnyia ne, nnɛmɔbu bɛ atɛn. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Sona bie le gyidie kyɛ ɔkora di nikye biala, nakoso bɔ ye gyidie yɛ mmerɛ ne de, nyaa ngome yeɛ odi ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Sona bɔ odi nikye biala ne, nnɛmaa obu bɔ onni ne animtia; na bɔ onni ne koso, nnɛmaa obu bɔ odi ne atɛn, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ alɛ́ ye ato nu. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Wɔ yeɛ ɛle nwa bɔ ɛbu ebie akoaa atɛn ne? Sɛ okogyina oo, okofi ase oo, ɔwɔ ye bɔbɔ ye wura berɛ. Na okogyina koso, ofikyɛ Awurade kɔhora kɔmaa okogyina.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Ebie nwu ye kyɛ, kyẽa bie nwo hia tra ngyẽa bɔ waha ne; sona foforɛ koso nwu ye kyɛ ngyẽa namukoraati te pɛ. Ɛmɔma ebiala adwene si ye pi. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Sona bɔ obu kyẽa bie tra ebie ne, Awurade ti yeɛ ɔyɛ sɔ ɔ; na bɔ odi nikye biala ne, odi fa hyɛ Awurade anuonyam, ofikyɛ ɔda Nyameɛ ase. Na bɔ onni ne, Awurade ti yeɛ onni ɔ, nakoso ɔda Nyameɛ ase.<verse eid="ROM 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Yɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ ɔte ase ma ye nwo ɔ, na yɛ nu biala nne berɛ bɔ owu ma ye nwo ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Sɛ yɛte ase a, Awurade ti yeɛ yɛte ase ɔ; na sɛ yɛwu koso a, Awurade ti yeɛ yawu ɔ. Yeti, sɛ yɛte ase oo, sɛ yawu oo, yɛte Awurade deɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ Kristo wuli ne, osa wale ngoa nu ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɔkɔyɛ ateasefoɛ ne awufo mukoraati Wura.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Nzuati yeɛ ebu eliema atɛn ne? Anaa nzuati yeɛ ebu eliema animtia ne? Ofikyɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛkogyina Nyameɛ atemmuo bia ne nyunu. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Bahworɔ kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Awurade nwa nyoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">‘Nde ase ye de,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">Me yeɛ nangoroma biala kobu ndwerɛ wɔ me nyunu ɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">na ebiala kɔye Nyameɛ ayɛ.’ ”<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Yeti, yɛ nu biala kobu ye bɔbɔ ye ngondaa kohyire Nyameɛ.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa yɛ nu biala bu ye mmango atɛn kõ, mmom ɛmɔsi ɛmɔ adwene pi kyɛ, ɛmɔngɔfa sintidua anaa akwansideɛ biala bɛngɔto aliemaa biala nyunu. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mese, na nne gyidie wɔ Awurade Yesu nu kyɛ, nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ ye bɔbɔ de, ye nwo nde ɔ; mmom sɛ ebie nwu ye kyɛ nikye bie nwo nde a, ye yeɛ ye nwo nde mma ye ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Na sɛ aleɛ bɔ edi to eliema sintidua a, ye de, ɛnnate ɔdɔ nu kõ. Nnɛfa w'aleɛ bɔ edi ne sɛkye sona bɔ Kristo awu ama ye ne. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Yeti, nnɛmɔ maa bɛka pa bɔ ɛmɔyɛ nanwo dwirɛ tɛɛ. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ Ahennie ne, ɔtte aleɛ bɔ yɛkoli ne nzãa bɔ yɛkɔno, mmom ɔte tenenee, asomdwie ne anigye bɔ ɔnate honhom krongron naso. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔsõ Kristo wɔ sɔ atee he aso ne, ɔsɔ Nyameɛ nye, na mmenia koso de ye to nu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Yeti, ɛmɔma yɛfa y'adwene yɛsie nningyein bɔ ɔfa asomdwie ba ɔne nningyein bɔ ɔhyɛ ngunaen naso. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Aleɛ ti, nnɛmɔsɛkye Nyameɛ adwuma. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, aleɛ biala nwo te, nakoso ɔte bɔne kyɛ ebie koli nikye bɔ ɔkɔto oliema sintidua ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ɔte pa kyɛ ɛngoli naen, anaa ɛngɔno nzãa, anaa ɛngɔyɛ nikye biala bɔ ɔkɔto eliema sintidua ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Gyidie bɔ ɛle ye wɔ sɔ nningyein nanwo ne, ma ɔyɛ ɛne Nyameɛ afia dwirɛ. Anigye yeɛ ole sona bɔ ommu ye nwo atɛn wɔ nningyein bɔ wale wato nu kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ nanwo. <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Nakoso, sɛ ye adwene nu yɛ ye nnaa, na sɛ odi a, wali fɔ; ofikyɛ nna gyidie yeɛ ɔfa di ɔ. Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, nikye biala bɔ oggyi gyidie so ne, ɔte bɔne.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Yɛ bɔ yɛyɛ se ne, odikyɛ yɛsoa bɛ bɔ bɛnyɛ se ne mmerɛyɛ, na nnɛmɔ maa yɛyɛ bɔ ɔkɔsɔ yɛ mmom yɛ nye ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Ɛmɔma yɛ nu biala yɛ bɔ ɔkɔsɔ ye mmango nye, nikye bɔ ɔkɔmaa okonya ngɔsoɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />Ofikyɛ Kristo po anyɛ bɔ okuro; mmom kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne: “Bɛ bɔ bɛgua ɛmɔ nyunu ase ne, bɛ animguaseɛ ne awa me so.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Na nikye biala bɔ bahworɔ bato berɛ ne, bahworɔ kyɛ ohyirehyire yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛnate animia ne awerɛkyekye bɔ ɔwɔ tworɔnzɛm nanu naso konya anidasoɛ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nyameɛ bɔ ɔma animia ne awerɛkyekye ne, ɔma ɛmɔnya adwene bɔ ne Kristo Yesu le ye ne bie, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ kɔyɛ kõ, na ɛmɔ afa konviɛ kõ bahyɛ y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Nyameɛ ne ye Baba ne anuonyam.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Yeti ebiala lɛ́ ye mmango to nu, kyɛbɔ Kristo alɛ́ ɛmɔ ato nu ne, na wamaa wahyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Meka mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ, Nyameɛ nahorɛlilɛ ti, Kristo wale kyɛ ɔbaasõ bɛ bɔ bapɛ bɛ toa ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛbɔ bɔ ɔhyɛle bɛ nana mɔ ne kɔwa nu, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />ná Nyameɛ anwunvoin ti, maen-maen ne ahyɛ ye anuonyam. Ofikyɛ kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Ɛhe ati yeɛ ngɔye wɔ ayɛ wɔ maen-maen nanu ne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">na ngɔto ayɛyie dwein ngɔma wɔ dumaa.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Na osa hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Maen-maen nanufoɛ, ɛmɔ ne ye mmenia ne nye gye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Yeɛ ɔhane ye bieku kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Maen-maen namukoraati, ɛmɔye Awurade ayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">ná ma mmenia mukoraati ye y'ayɛ.”<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Na Isaiah koso hane kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Yese ndii ne kɔwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ɔkɔwa kooli maen-maen naso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ye yeɛ maen-maen ne kɔfa bɛ nye bɛkɔto ye so ɔ.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Gyidie bɔ ɛmɔ anya ye wɔ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔma anidasoɛ ne nu nati, ɔma ɛmɔ anigye ne asomdwie mukoraati bie, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɔnate honhom krongron né tumi so ne, ɛmɔ anidasoɛ ne kobu so.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Nniemamɔ, medɛ́ medi paa kyɛ, paayɛlɛ ayi ɛmɔ bo, na ɛmɔ anya nimdeɛ mukoraati bie maa waboso, yeti ebiala kɔhora kɔhyɛ ye mmango ngunaen.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Kohyirehyire ye mmango.”</char></note> <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Nakoso edwirɛ biemɔ wɔ berɛ a, mahworɔ ye pen-pen mabrɛ ɛmɔ, kyɛbɔ ngosa ngɔkaye ɛmɔ ɔ. Ɔnate adom bɔ Nyameɛ afa alo me <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />kyɛ nyɛ Kristo Yesu badwanu somvoɛ mma maen-maen nati, mafa me nwo mawura Nyameɛ nzɛmba nwo adwuma krongron nanu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a maen hemɔ kɔyɛ afɔleɛ bɔ ɔsɔ anyeɛ, bɔ bafa honhom krongron bate ye nwo. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Yeti adwuma bɔ meyɛ mema Nyameɛ ne, nne bɔ ngɔhora ngogyina so ngoli ahurusi wɔ Kristo Yesu nu. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Bɔ Kristo nate me so ayɛ ne, ɛhene ngome yeɛ ngosi me hue ngɔha ye nwo dwirɛ ɔ. Kristo nate me dwirɛ ne m'adwuma so amaa maen-maen ne ayɛ sotie. <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />Ɔfale nzɛngyerɛneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ tumi, ɔne honhom krongron né tumi so yeɛ ɔyɛle sɔ ɔ. Yeti maha Kristo nwo nzɛmba ne fekɔ-fekɔ mafi Yerusalem tonn maadwu Ilirikum. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Yeti, mva nziele me nye so kyɛ, mengɔha nzɛmba ne wɔ nekaa bɔ bate Kristo dumaa ne nwo dwirɛ dada ne, na manzi manzie ebie fapem so; <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />mmom kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Bɛ bɔ bɛhanne ye nwo dwirɛ bɛhyirelle bɛ ne konwu ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">na bɛ bɔ bɛtelle ne kɔte yebo.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ bɛsili me atee mmerɛ pee, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mengɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ ne. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Nakoso kesaalae de, nekaa biala nne ɛmɔ mandanu berɛ bɔ ngane edwirɛ ne wɔ berɛ ɔ, na afoɛ pee yeɛ me nye agyina kyɛ ngonwu ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Yeti me nye la so kyɛ mekɔ Spain a, ngonwu ɛmɔ. Na sɛ mene ɛmɔ tena berɛ kaa a, né ɛmɔ asoma me atee kaa maa mahɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Nakoso kesaalae de, me gya gyi atee so bɔ mekɔ Yerusalem mekɔsõ akrongronfoɛ nemɔ. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Ofikyɛ ɔyɛ Makedonia ne Akaiafoɛ nemɔ fɛ kyɛ baye ndoboa kaa kyɛ bɛfa bɛkɔma akrongronfoɛ bɔ wahia bɛ wɔ Yerusalem ne. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Nahorɛ nu, anigye yeɛ bɛfa bɛyɛle sɔ ɔ, nakoso né bɛma bɛ kerɛ; ofikyɛ sɛ́ bɛne maen-maen ne ahyɛ bɛ honhom nu nningyein a, ye de bɛ koso, odikyɛ bɛfa bɛ anwoɔnaen nu nningyein bɛsõ bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Yeti sɛ meyie ɛhe, na mefa ndoboa ne mewura bɛ sa nu a, ngɔfa ɛmɔ berɛ ngɔhɔ Spain. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Mese kyɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ a ngɔfa Kristo nhyira bɔ wabu so ngɔwa.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Aliemaa mɔ, kesaalae de, nnate y'Awurade Yesu Kristo ne honhom né dɔ so mesrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ, ɛmɔboka me so, na ɛmɔyere ɛmɔ nwo bɛbɔ Nyameɛ mbaeɛ bɛma me. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Ɛmɔbɔ mbaeɛ kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkole me bɛkofi Yudeafoɛ bɔ bennɛ benni ne sa nu, na ɔsom adwuma bɔ mekwaayɛ ye wɔ Yerusalem ne koso, akrongronfoɛ ne kole kɔto nu, <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />na sɛ ɔte Nyameɛ pɛ a, ngɔfa anigye ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ, na mene ɛmɔ mukoraati, yɛ nwo atɔ yɛ. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Asomdwie Nyameɛ ne, ɔboka ɛmɔ mukoraati so. Amen.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Meka yɛliema brasua Foibe bɔ ɔsõ wɔ asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Kenkrea nanu nanwo dwirɛ mekyire ɛmɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Ɛmɔle ye wɔ Awurade nu, kyɛbɔ ɛmɔdɛ akrongronfoɛ ne, na mmokalɛ biala bɔ ohia ne, ɛmɔfa bɛma ye. Ofikyɛ waboka mmeni pee, na me koso, waboka me paa.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Ɛmɔhyea Priska<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ bɛfrɛ ye “Prisila” ne, Akwila aye ne.</char></note> ne Akwila bɛma me, bɛte me mmango bɔ mene bɛ yɛ adwuma wɔ Kristo Yesu nu; <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />bɛfale bɛ ngoa po bɛtole berɛ bɛmane me. Meda bɛ ase paa, nná me ngome, asafo ahoroɛ bɔ bɛwɔ maen-maen nanu namukoraati koso nwa bɛda bɛ ase. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Ná ɛmɔhyea asafo bɔ beyia nu wɔ b'awuro berɛ ne koso bɛma me.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Ɛmɔhyea me dɔfo Epaineto bɛma me; Kristofoɛ bɔ bɛli moa wɔ Asia ne, ɔboka so.<verse eid="ROM 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Ɛmɔhyea Mary bɛma me, wayɛ adwuma serɛ paa wama ɛmɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Ɛmɔhyea Androniko ne Junias bɛma me, bɛte m'abusuafoɛ ne me mmango bɔ né mene bɛ la prizin. Sɔ mmrienzua hemɔ de, asomafoɛ ne se bɛ paa, na bɛɛyɛle Kristofoɛ kora yeɛ mebaayɛ Kristoniɛ ɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Mekyea Ampilato, ɔte me damvo bɔ medɔ ye wɔ Kristo nu.<verse eid="ROM 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ɛmɔhyea Urbano bɛma me, ɔte me mmango bɔ mene ye yɛ adwuma wɔ Kristo nu; me dɔfo Staki koso, ɛmɔhyea ye bɛma me.<verse eid="ROM 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ɛmɔhyea Apele bɔ balɛ́ ye bato nu wɔ Kristo nu ne bɛma me.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:10">Mekyea Aristobulo awurofoɛ koso.<verse eid="ROM 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ɛmɔhyea m'abusuaniɛ Herodion bɛma me.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:11">Ɛmɔhyea Narkiso awurofoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Awurade nu ne bɛma me.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Ɛmɔhyea Trifena ne Trifosa, mmrasua bɔ bɛyɛ adwuma serɛ bɛma Awurade ne bɛma me.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:12">Ɛmɔhyea yɛ dɔfo Persis koso bɛma yɛ, ofikyɛ wayɛ adwuma serɛ wama Awurade.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Mekyea Rufus bɔ baye ye wɔ Awurade nu ne, ɔne ye maame, bɔ wafa me wayɛ ɔwa ne.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Ɛmɔhyea Asinkrito, Flegon, Herme, Patroba, Herma, ne mmrienzua bɔ bɛboka bɛ so ne bɛma me.<verse eid="ROM 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ɛmɔhyea Filologo ne Julia, Nereo ne oliema brasua ne, ɔne Olimpa ne akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛboka bɛ so namukoraati bɛma me.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Ɛmɔfa mveanoɛ krongron bɛhyeɛhyea ɛmɔ nwo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:16">Kristo asafo namukoraati nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Aliemaa mɔ, kesaalae de mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔnea ɛmɔ nwo yé wɔ bɛ bɔ bɛfa mbakye-mbakye-muɛ bɛba, na bɛto sintidua bɔ ɔne ngyerɛkyerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ asua ne nnyia nanwo, na ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo bɛfi bɛ nwo. <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ofikyɛ sɔ mmenia nemɔ, bɛtte Awurade Kristo ngoaa, mmom bɛte ngoaa bɛma bɛ bɔbɔ bɛ ko, na bɛ bɔ adwemmɔne biala nne bɛ tianu ne, bɛfa edwirɛ bɔ ɔyɛ fɛ ne nnɛdɛɛ so bɛlaka-laka bɛ. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ebiala anwu sotie bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne, na me nye agye ama ɛmɔ. Nakoso mepena kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ anyanzafoɛ wɔ nningyein pa nwo, na ɛmɔtwe ɛmɔ nwo koraa bɛfi bɔne nwo. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Ɔngɔhyɛ, asomdwie Nyameɛ ne kɔpɛkyɛ Satan koraa wɔ ɛmɔ gya bo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ROM 16:20">Y'Awurade Yesu Kristo adom ne ɛmɔ tena.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoteo bɔ ɔte me mmango bɔ mene ye yɛ adwuma ne nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ, na sɔ ala yeɛ m'abusuafoɛ Lukio, Yason ne Sosipata koso nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Me Tertio yeɛ ndworɔle krataa he ɔ, me koso mekyea ɛmɔ wɔ Awurade nu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gaius bɔ ndenane ye awuro, na asafo namukoraati yia nu wɔ ye awuro ne nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:23">Erasto bɔ ɔnea kuro ne sikaa so ne nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ, na oliema Kwarto koso nwa ɔkyea ɛmɔ. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" /><note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sɛ ɛnea Bible biemɔ nu a, bafa edwirɛ bie bawura ɛwa kyɛ: </char><char style="bdit">“Y'Awurade Yesu Kristo adom ha ɛmɔ mukoraati. Amen.”</char> Nakoso sɔ dwirɛ ne, ɛnea asaanoa ndworɔyɛ bɔ wahyɛ paa na odi mu paa nemɔ nu a, ɔnne nu.</note>—<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Nyameɛ bɔ ɔkɔhora kɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ se ne nate nzɛmba bɔ meka, ɔne Yesu Kristo nwo asɛnka naso, kyɛbɔ edwirɛ krongron bɔ wafea mmerɛ-tende, <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />na kesaalae waye ye ali ne te ne; ɔnate ngɔmhyɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Tworɔnzɛm nanu naso ala ye ali maa maen-maen namukoraati anwu ye, kyɛbɔ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ase daa ne ahyɛ kyɛ bɛfa gyidie so bɛyɛ sotie ne. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Nyameɛ bɔ ye ngome yeɛ ɔse nworɛ ne, ye yeɛ anuonyam fa y'Awurade Yesu Kristo ha ye daa daa! Amen.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>